 o-shot footage of Papa V Perpetua and his band of Nameless Ghouls from the
  phone-free SKELETOUR\, 2 BIG TO RIG immerses the audience in the GHOST li
 ve ritual\, including exclusive behind-the-scenes and backstage access. <b
 r/><br/>2 BIG TO RIG was created to share the SKELETOUR experience with th
 e faithful in the territories where staging the show was not logistically 
