DESCRIPTION:Filmed at Paris' iconic Accor Arena during Katy Perry's sold-o
 ut Lifetimes Tour performances in November 2025\, Katy Perry: The Lifetime
 s Tour – Live From Paris captures one of pop music's most spectacular li
 ve productions at its peak. Directed by acclaimed concert filmmaker Paul D
 ugdale and shot with more than 60 camera angles\, the film delivers an imm
 ersive front-row experience that showcases the scale\, energy\, and visual
  ambition of Perry's global tour.<br/><br/>Featuring a career-spanning set
 list packed with chart-topping hits\, dazzling production design\, breatht
 aking choreography\, and electrifying audience moments\, the film celebrat
 es Katy Perry as a world-class performer at the top of her game. From inti
 mate fan connections to arena-shaking anthems\, every moment is captured w
 ith cinematic precision\, placing viewers at the heart of an unforgettable
  live event.<br/><br/>More than a concert film\, The Lifetimes Tour – Li
 ve From Paris is a vibrant celebration of Perry's enduring connection with
  her fans and the music that has defined a generation. Dynamic\, emotional
 \, and exhilarating\, it is the ultimate showcase of one of pop's most ico
 nic entertainers in full command of the stage.<br/>
